{"seq":1,"slug":"pending-available-balance","title":"在途/可提现/冻结余额","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/escrow-available-balance/pending-available-balance","wordCount":1781,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"在途-可提现-冻结余额\">在途/可提现/冻结余额</h1><p>账本上商家的货款是 14200 分，但商家能提走多少、什么时候能提，是另一个问题。把这两个问题混为一谈是实时结算系统最典型的设计缺陷——它会让一次误操作直接变成资金出表。本文给出余额的分区模型：桶有哪些、桶之间如何迁移、以及分区余额必须满足哪些不变式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个余额桶\">核心概念：四个余额桶</h2><p>余额不是一个数字，是四个数字。每个桶回答一个不同的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>桶</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>能否被提现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>pending</code> 在途</td>\n<td>钱已记入商家名下，但平台尚未从渠道实际收到</td>\n<td>「平台欠商家多少还没到手的钱」</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>available</code> 可提现</td>\n<td>钱已到平台账上，且释放条件已满足</td>\n<td>「商家现在最多能提多少」</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>frozen</code> 冻结</td>\n<td>钱在商家名下，但因争议/违规被锁</td>\n<td>「有多少钱被争议或处罚锁住」</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reserved</code> 预留</td>\n<td>已受理提现申请，尚未打款成功</td>\n<td>「有多少钱正在出表途中」</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个桶的关系可以用一句话概括：<strong><code>pending</code> 是时间问题，<code>frozen</code> 是权利问题，<code>reserved</code> 是流程问题，只有 <code>available</code> 是可动用的钱。</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[订单分账] --&gt;|货款入账| P[pending 在途]&#10;    P --&gt;|渠道到账 + 释放条件满足| V[available 可提现]&#10;    V --&gt;|争议/违规| F[frozen 冻结]&#10;    F --&gt;|申诉通过| V&#10;    F --&gt;|划扣| X[出表: 赔付/罚没]&#10;    V --&gt;|提现申请受理| R[reserved 预留]&#10;    R --&gt;|打款成功| Y[出表: 已打款]&#10;    R --&gt;|打款失败| V&#10;    P --&gt;|退款冲分| Z[反向冲回]&#10;    V --&gt;|退款冲分| Z\">graph TD\n    A[订单分账] --&gt;|货款入账| P[pending 在途]\n    P --&gt;|渠道到账 + 释放条件满足| V[available 可提现]\n    V --&gt;|争议/违规| F[frozen 冻结]\n    F --&gt;|申诉通过| V\n    F --&gt;|划扣| X[出表: 赔付/罚没]\n    V --&gt;|提现申请受理| R[reserved 预留]\n    R --&gt;|打款成功| Y[出表: 已打款]\n    R --&gt;|打款失败| V\n    P --&gt;|退款冲分| Z[反向冲回]\n    V --&gt;|退款冲分| Z</pre><p><strong>为什么 <code>pending</code> 必须独立存在？</strong> 因为它承担了一个关键风险：如果平台在还没从渠道收到钱时就让商家提走，一旦渠道结算失败或延迟，平台要用自有资金垫付。中国《非银行支付机构条例》与欧盟电子货币指令对客户资金都有明确的保障要求，其核心之一就是<strong>不能用未到账的资金对外支付</strong>。把「已记入商家名下」和「可以付出去」分开，是把这条要求落成系统约束的最直接方式。</p>\n<p><strong><code>reserved</code> 的存在是为了防重复提现。</strong> 商家提交提现申请后到打款成功之间有时间窗口（通常几小时到一天），如果这段窗口内余额仍是 <code>available</code>，商家可以立刻再提交一次，系统就会超额打款。受理时立刻从 <code>available</code> 转入 <code>reserved</code>，是唯一可靠的防重方式——它把「资金占用」变成了一个原子操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"桶间的迁移与不变式\">桶间的迁移与不变式</h2><p>余额分区不是四个独立字段，它们<strong>必须满足账本可推导性</strong>：任何时刻，从账本重放得到的各桶余额，必须等于快照表里的值。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munder><mo>±</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{bucket} = \\sum_{e \\in E_{bucket}} \\pm e.amountMinor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4502em;vertical-align:-1.4002em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4002em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">tM</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{bucket}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是影响该桶的全部分录，符号由方向决定。这条不变式是分区模型能被审计的前提，也是<a href=\"../realtime-vs-batch/split-discrepancy\">分账差异检测与修复</a>的检出手法。</p>\n<p>迁移必须是<strong>原子且可追溯</strong>的：一次 <code>pending → available</code> 的释放，在账本上表现为两条分录（<code>pending</code> 借记、<code>available</code> 贷记），而不是在两个字段上各做一次 <code>UPDATE</code>。理由与<a href=\"../transaction-split/realtime-ledger-entry\">实时分账记账与只追加账本</a>完全相同——余额变动必须有分录支撑，否则不可审计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BalanceTransfer {&#10;  accountId: string;&#10;  fromBucket: &#39;PENDING&#39; | &#39;AVAILABLE&#39; | &#39;FROZEN&#39; | &#39;RESERVED&#39;;&#10;  toBucket: &#39;PENDING&#39; | &#39;AVAILABLE&#39; | &#39;FROZEN&#39; | &#39;RESERVED&#39; | &#39;OUT&#39;;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  amountMinor: number;&#10;  bizType: &#39;RELEASE&#39; | &#39;FREEZE&#39; | &#39;UNFREEZE&#39; | &#39;RESERVE&#39; | &#39;PAYOUT&#39; | &#39;DEDUCT&#39;;&#10;  bizRefId: string;&#10;  idemKey: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function transfer(t: BalanceTransfer): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  return db.transaction(async (tx) =&gt; {&#10;    const src = await tx.balances.lock(t.accountId, t.fromBucket, t.currency);&#10;    if (src.balanceMinor &lt; t.amountMinor) throw new InsufficientBalance(t);&#10;    const entries: LedgerEntry[] = [&#10;      mkEntry(t.accountId, t.fromBucket, &#39;DEBIT&#39;, t.amountMinor, t),&#10;      mkEntry(t.accountId, t.toBucket, &#39;CREDIT&#39;, t.amountMinor, t),&#10;    ];&#10;    assertBalanced(entries);&#10;    await tx.entries.insertMany(entries);&#10;    await tx.balances.applyDelta(t.accountId, t.fromBucket, -t.amountMinor);&#10;    await tx.balances.applyDelta(t.accountId, t.toBucket, +t.amountMinor);&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BalanceTransfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  accountId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fromBucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'AVAILABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  toBucket</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'AVAILABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FROZEN'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amountMinor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bizType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FREEZE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UNFREEZE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PAYOUT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEDUCT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  bizRefId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  idemKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BalanceTransfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.balances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t.accountId, t.fromBucket, t.currency);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (src.balanceMinor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t.amountMinor) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InsufficientBalance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      mkEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t.accountId, t.fromBucket, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEBIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, t.amountMinor, t),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      mkEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t.accountId, t.toBucket, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CREDIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, t.amountMinor, t),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    assertBalanced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entries);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.entries.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insertMany</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entries);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.balances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">applyDelta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t.accountId, t.fromBucket, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t.amountMinor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.balances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">applyDelta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t.accountId, t.toBucket, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t.amountMinor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lock</code> 必须是行级悲观锁或等价的乐观并发控制。<strong>这里不能只靠「先读再判断」</strong>：两个并发的提现受理请求都读到 <code>available = 10000</code>，各自认为可以受理 8000，结果是 16000 被预留。可用性检查与扣减必须在同一个持锁区间内完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负余额与坏账边界\">负余额与坏账边界</h2><p>商家余额理论上不该为负，但现实中有两条路径会把它推成负数。</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：已提现后退款。</strong> 商家在 T 日提走了全部货款，T+5 日买家申请退款，退款必须从商家余额扣，而余额是 0。这在跨境场景里非常常见——售后期长于结算周期时几乎必然发生。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：拒付（chargeback）。</strong> 买家向发卡行发起拒付，渠道直接从平台扣款，平台必须向商家追索。拒付通常还附带渠道罚金，金额可能超过原交易额。</p>\n<p>处理负余额有三条政策路线，选择它的是<strong>风险管理策略而非技术偏好</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>政策</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>允许负余额</td>\n<td><code>available</code> 可小于 0，从后续交易自动抵扣</td>\n<td>商家体验平滑</td>\n<td>商家关店跑路，坏账落平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保证金抵扣</td>\n<td>强制商家缴纳保证金，负余额优先从保证金扣</td>\n<td>风险闭环</td>\n<td>保证金门槛会劝退中小商家</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提现门槛与延迟</td>\n<td>售后期结束才可提现（T+N，N ≥ 售后期）</td>\n<td>从源头消除路径一</td>\n<td>商家现金流受损，竞争力下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>最优解通常是组合</strong>：中小商家走「售后期后释放」（从源头消除路径一），大商家走「T+0 释放 + 保证金」（换取现金流优势）。</p>\n<p>无论选哪条，系统都需要一个<strong>负余额监测与升级机制</strong>：负余额账户列表、负余额金额、持续时长。超过阈值触发自动冻结（禁止新提现）与人工介入。<strong>让负余额静默增长是最不可接受的</strong>——它是坏账在累积，而账面上看起来一切正常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"币种维度-桶是二维的\">币种维度：桶是二维的</h2><p>余额的真正坐标是 <code>(accountId, bucket, currency)</code> 三元组，而不是 <code>(accountId, bucket)</code>。一个跨境商家可能同时持有 USD、EUR、CNY 三个币种的余额，每个币种独立分区、独立释放、独立提现。</p>\n<p><strong>关键设计约束：不同币种的桶之间不能直接迁移。</strong> 把 EUR 余额「转成」USD 余额是一次结汇（FX conversion），它有汇率、有损益、有合规申报要求，绝不能实现成两条余额更新。结汇的处理见<a href=\"../fund-safety/multi-currency-settle\">多币种分账与结汇</a>。</p>\n<p>一个容易踩的坑是<strong>币种在小数位上不同</strong>：JPY 没有小数位（minor unit = 0），KRW 同样，而 USD/EUR 是 2 位，某些币种历史上是 3 位。所有余额计算必须读 <code>currency.minorUnit</code> 而不是硬编码 <code>/100</code>，展示层的格式化也必须用它。把 <code>amountMinor / 100</code> 写死，会在 JPY 上把 1000 日元显示成 10 日元。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>余额是四个桶不是四个字段</strong>：<code>pending</code>（时间问题）、<code>frozen</code>（权利问题）、<code>reserved</code>（流程问题）、<code>available</code>（唯一可动用的钱）。</li>\n<li><strong><code>pending</code> 存在的意义是禁止用未到账资金对外支付</strong>；<code>reserved</code> 存在的意义是原子防重复提现。</li>\n<li><strong>桶间迁移必须是原子事务 + 两条分录</strong>，并把余额快照的可推导性作为不变式：从账本重放必须等于快照。</li>\n<li><strong>可用性检查与扣减必须在同一持锁区间内</strong>，先读后写会让并发提现超额预留。</li>\n<li><strong>负余额有三条政策路线</strong>（允许负余额 / 保证金抵扣 / 售后期后释放），通常组合使用；必须有负余额监测与自动冻结升级机制。</li>\n<li><strong>桶的坐标是 <code>(账户, 桶, 币种)</code> 三元组</strong>，跨币种转账是结汇不是余额更新；币种小数位必须从货币元数据读取。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>余额分好桶之后，接下来的问题是每个桶之间的迁移由什么触发——货款什么时候从 <code>pending</code> 走到 <code>available</code>，见<a href=\"settlement-release-rule\">确认收货/售后期满释放规则</a>；<code>available</code> 里的钱怎么真正离开平台，见<a href=\"withdrawal-flow\">提现申请/审核/打款</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"在途/可提现/冻结余额","id":"在途-可提现-冻结余额"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个余额桶","id":"核心概念-四个余额桶"},{"level":2,"text":"桶间的迁移与不变式","id":"桶间的迁移与不变式"},{"level":2,"text":"负余额与坏账边界","id":"负余额与坏账边界"},{"level":2,"text":"币种维度：桶是二维的","id":"币种维度-桶是二维的"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分账幂等与退款冲分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/transaction-split/split-idempotent"},"next":{"title":"确认收货/售后期满释放规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-merchant-settlement/escrow-available-balance/settlement-release-rule"}}